When you need a tool, output a JSON object inside <tool_call>...</tool_call> tags.
Format:
<tool_call>
{"name":"tool_name","arguments":{}}
</tool_call>
You may include normal assistant text outside tool_call blocks. After tool results arrive, continue reasoning and then answer normally.

