## Snapshot Reading Guide
- current_scene should describe the present outer scene using interaction_mode, activity_rhythm, and situational_pull.
- body_state should translate device/body/resource_tension into a lived operational condition.
- social_field should capture how open, paused, direct, or distant the interaction field feels right now.
- world_changes should name what recently shifted in the outside situation, not your inward state.
- external_focus should say what in the external world deserves attention next.


